    "id": "bihar-approves-10mw-solar-power-plant-on-son-canal",
    "legacyId": 5591,
    "title": "Bihar approves 10MW solar power plant on Son Canal.",
    "summary": "Solar Revolution in Bihar: Son Canal to Power the Future with 10MW Clean Energy Project When Sunlight Meets Water: Bihar’s Bold Energy Leap Imagine canals that don’t just carry water—but also carry the future of energy. That vision is now becoming real in Bihar. The state is stepping into a new era where sunlight and [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h1 data-section-id=\"1vvgcgx\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"20\"><strong data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"112\">Solar Revolution in Bihar: Son Canal to Power the Future with 10MW Clean Energy Project</strong></h1>\n<hr data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"117\" />\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1tm4vj9\" data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"176\">When Sunlight Meets Water: Bihar’s Bold Energy Leap</h2>\n<p data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"417\">Imagine canals that don’t just carry water—but also carry the future of energy. That vision is now becoming real in <strong data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"303\">Bihar</strong>. The state is stepping into a new era where sunlight and infrastructure work together to power millions of lives.</p>\n<p data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"603\">Now, the government has approved a <strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"480\">10MW solar power plant</strong> on the embankment of the <strong data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"547\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Western Son Canal</span></span></strong>. This is not just a project. It is a shift in thinking.</p>\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"762\">Moreover, this initiative blends innovation with sustainability. As a result, Bihar is moving closer to energy independence while protecting its environment.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"767\" />\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kf4ajd\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"820\">Project Details: Where Innovation Takes Shape</h2>\n<p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"957\">The plan focuses on the first one-kilometer stretch of the canal. Around <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"917\">80,000 square feet</strong> of space will host modern solar panels.</p>\n<p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1089\">Additionally, the state power company will build and operate the plant directly. This ensures faster execution and better control.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1224\">Importantly, the <strong data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1138\">Water Resources Department</strong> has already granted the NOC. Therefore, the tender process is expected to begin soon.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1369\">Furthermore, this model solves a major problem—land scarcity. Instead of acquiring new land, Bihar is optimizing existing canal infrastructure.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1374\" />\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ko6rmj\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1427\">Safety First: Protecting Canal Infrastructure</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1574\">While the project is ambitious, safety remains a top priority. Authorities have clearly instructed that the canal embankments must remain strong.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1683\">Therefore, engineers will design the installation carefully. They will ensure zero damage to the structure.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1785\">At the same time, continuous monitoring will help maintain both energy output and structural safety.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1790\" />\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1h3qyv5\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1846\"> Green Bihar Vision: Clean Energy, Cleaner Future</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1979\">This project strongly supports Bihar’s environmental goals. It aligns perfectly with the state’s <strong data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1970\">“Jal-Jeevan-Hariyali”</strong> mission.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2113\">As a result, the plant will reduce carbon emissions significantly. It will also promote renewable energy adoption across the region.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2264\">Moreover, local areas will benefit from stable voltage and improved electricity supply. This will directly impact homes, farms, and small businesses.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2269\" />\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wtn5t6\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2309\"> A Pilot That Can Transform Bihar</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2406\">Interestingly, this is just the beginning. The Son Canal project will act as a <strong data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2405\">pilot model</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2576\">If successful, similar solar installations may appear along <strong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2476\">Kosi</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2491\">Gandak</strong> canals. Consequently, Bihar could develop a vast solar network across its waterways.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2670\">In addition, this approach can inspire other Indian states to rethink energy infrastructure.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2675\" />\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1c0yod0\" data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2718\"> Why This Matters for Bihar’s Future</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2784\">This project is more than electricity generation. It represents:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2955\">\n<li data-section-id=\"jzeqtm\" data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2826\">Smarter use of public infrastructure</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14gdjfs\" data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2868\">Faster transition to renewable energy</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15oxwso\" data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2920\">Reduced dependency on traditional power sources</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"128x10l\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2955\">Stronger rural electrification</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"3041\">Therefore, Bihar is not just solving today’s problems. It is preparing for tomorrow.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3046\" />\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zwb7uw\" data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3087\">Be Part of Bihar’s Transformation</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3218\">Stories like these are reshaping how the world sees Bihar. And this is just one of many powerful changes happening on the ground.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3330\">👉 Follow <strong data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3250\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3248\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong> for more such regular updates and become part of the <strong data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3329\">13K+ global community</strong>!</p>\n<p data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3513\"><strong data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3345\">Bihar Say</strong> is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform. It is reshaping the state&#8217;s image through impactful stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3668\">With <strong data-start=\"3520\" data-end=\"3541\">13,000+ followers</strong>, top LinkedIn impressions, and partnerships with platforms like DailyHunt, Bihar Say stands as the <strong data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3667\">digital voice of Bihar</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3786\">🎙️ Don’t miss <em data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3696\">BiharCast</em>—its flagship podcast uncovering untold stories and rising voices from the heart of Bihar.</p>\n",
