    "id": "bihar-bhumi-live-land-verification-see-your-property-before-registry",
    "legacyId": 5513,
    "title": "Bihar Bhumi Live Land Verification: See Your Property Before Registry",
    "summary": "Bihar Bhumi Revolution: See Your Land Live Before Registry, Ending Fraud and Fake Deals! Catch the Land Before You Buy: Bihar Bhumi Goes Live!Bihar is stepping into the future of land registration with a revolutionary move. Now, before any land, flat, or commercial property registry, buyers can see a live image of the property, complete [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<p data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"484\"><strong data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"482\">Bihar Bhumi Revolution: See Your Land Live Before Registry, Ending Fraud and Fake Deals!</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"898\"><strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"561\">Catch the Land Before You Buy: Bihar Bhumi Goes Live!</strong><br data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"564\" />Bihar is stepping into the future of land registration with a revolutionary move. Now, before any land, flat, or commercial property registry, buyers can see a <strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"754\">live image of the property</strong>, complete with location and ownership details. This innovation aims to clamp down on fraudulent sales and empower citizens like never before.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"903\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"952\">Real-Time Land Verification to Stop Fraud</h3>\n<p data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1191\">The Bihar government has introduced a <strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1018\">technology-based system</strong> to make land registration fully transparent. Under the new framework, every property must have an actual photograph uploaded to the government portal before registration.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1491\">This photograph, linked with exact <strong data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1247\">GPS coordinates</strong>, ensures buyers know exactly what they are purchasing. The system also verifies the rightful owner automatically. Consequently, if a land mafia or unauthorized seller tries to resell the same property, the registration will stop immediately.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1496\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1541\">Fixing the Current System’s Loopholes</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1721\">Earlier, GPS cameras were used for verification, but inaccuracies often arose, especially in rural areas. Locations could be off by up to a kilometer, leaving room for disputes.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1927\">With this <strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1749\">new software</strong>, on-spot photographs and precise coordinates remove ambiguities. Buyers will see the <strong data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1871\">true condition of their property</strong>, avoiding disputes and reducing delays significantly.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1932\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1970\">Instant Updates on Your Mobile</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2209\">Once a registry is completed, buyers will receive an <strong data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2074\">SMS containing the property’s complete details</strong>, including the uploaded photograph. This serves as a legal record and eliminates the need to visit offices repeatedly for documents.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2214\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2257\">Easier Property Transactions Online</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2504\">The system also streamlines the <strong data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2315\">Dakhil-Kharij process</strong>. Nearly 60% of property filings can now be processed online. Trials across districts like Darbhanga have proven successful, and the government is preparing for full-scale implementation.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2673\">This change ensures buyers get exactly the property they paid for. Using Google Maps, they can verify the location quickly, reducing the chance of fraud drastically.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2678\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2713\">Empowering Bihar’s Citizens</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"3027\">This innovative technology makes <strong data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2790\">property buying safer and more reliable</strong>. Fraudsters will face tougher scrutiny, and citizens will gain confidence in every transaction. The Bihar Bhumi initiative is not just about technology—it’s about giving power back to the people and ensuring fairness in land dealings.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3032\" />\n<p data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3400\"><strong data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3398\">Stay updated with Bihar’s latest governance and technology initiatives! Follow <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3159\">www.biharsay.com</a> for more regular updates and become part of the 13k+ global community of Bihar enthusiasts. Bihar Say is Bihar’s leading apolitical media platform, reshaping the state’s image through stories on culture, business, and grassroots change.</strong></p>\n",
