    "id": "gaya-junction-50-train-route-changed-station-upgrade-updates",
    "legacyId": 5434,
    "title": "Gaya Junction: 50 Train Route Changed & Station Upgrade Updates",
    "summary": "गया जंक्शन में होने वाला है बड़ा बदलाव: यात्रियों के लिए सबसे अहम अपडेट यही है! Gaya Junction is entering a historic upgrade phase, and the next few weeks will decide how thousands of passengers travel through Bihar. The station is racing toward its 2026 goal of becoming a world-class railway hub, and the pace [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h1 data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"383\"><strong data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"383\"> गया जंक्शन में होने वाला है बड़ा बदलाव: यात्रियों के लिए सबसे अहम अपडेट यही है!</strong></h1>\n<p data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"739\">Gaya Junction is entering a historic upgrade phase, and the next few weeks will decide how thousands of passengers travel through Bihar. The station is racing toward its 2026 goal of becoming a <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"606\">world-class railway hub</strong>, and the pace is now faster than ever. Because of this push, a major change is arriving soon—one that will impact many train routes.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"744\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"797\"><strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"797\">Why Gaya Junction Is Undergoing a Mega Block</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"1203\">The redevelopment work at <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"842\">Gaya Junction</strong> has gained momentum. Extra workers have joined the ongoing project, and the target is clear: transform the station into a <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"997\">world-class facility by 2026</strong>.<br data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1001\" />Therefore, the last week of November becomes crucial. Platforms 2 and 3 will undergo a <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1102\">mega block</strong>, and teams will work on raising their height, extending their length, and upgrading their structure.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1433\">Because of this, nearly <strong data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1280\">10% of the trains will experience route changes</strong>, and a few may even face temporary cancellation. The goal, however, remains simple—ensure smooth travel while preparing the station for a modern future.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1438\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1483\"><strong data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1483\">Which Trains Will See Route Changes?</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1666\">Several trains that currently operate from Platforms 2 and 3 will face operational adjustments. Almost <strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1625\">50 trains use these two platforms</strong>, so the rearrangement becomes necessary.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1727\">However, two major trains will run without any disturbance:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1797\">\n<li data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1754\">\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1754\"><strong data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1752\">Mahabodhi Express</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1797\">\n<p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1797\"><strong data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1797\">Varanasi–Ranchi Vande Bharat Express</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1903\">These two important services will shift to Platforms 6 and 7 to avoid excessive pressure on busy tracks.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2077\">Meanwhile, other trains may operate from Platforms 4, 5, 6, 7, and even the PG line. This strategy helps distribute traffic and maintain steady movement across the station.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2082\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2131\"><strong data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2131\">How Railways Are Preparing for the Block</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2361\">Before the mega block starts, senior officials have demanded detailed reports from the local railway teams. These teams have already submitted most of the required information, including updates about the <strong data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2360\">50 affected trains</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2478\">Once the final assessment is complete, the railway administration will release a full list. This list will confirm:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2601\">\n<li data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2497\">\n<p data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2497\">Route changes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2536\">\n<p data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2536\">Temporary reductions in operations</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2568\">\n<p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2568\">Cancellations (if required)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2601\">\n<p data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2601\">Revised platform allocations</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2793\">Since these decisions will affect a large number of daily travelers, the railway team is updating every system in advance. This helps avoid confusion and reduces the chance of inconvenience.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2798\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2841\"><strong data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2841\">Why This Upgrade Matters for Bihar</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"3248\">The transformation of Gaya Junction is more than a routine construction project. It represents Bihar’s growing demand for better travel facilities. With every new structure, the station moves closer to becoming an international-standard railway hub.<br data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3095\" />Additionally, this upgrade supports the rising number of tourists, business travelers, students, and daily commuters who depend on this crucial junction.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3379\">And as Bihar continues to push for better connectivity, stations like Gaya set the tone for the state’s future travel experience.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3384\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3441\"><strong data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3441\">Stay Updated With More Bihar Development Stories</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3664\">The next few days will bring more official updates as railway teams finalise their decisions. New lists, route charts, and operational details will roll out soon, and every traveler passing through Gaya should stay alert.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3666\" data-end=\"4102\">👉 <strong data-start=\"3669\" data-end=\"4102\">Follow <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3694\">www.biharsay.com</a> for real-time Bihar travel updates, infrastructure news, and ground stories. Join our 13,000-strong global family and become part of Bihar’s fastest-growing digital storytelling community. Bihar Say remains Bihar’s leading apolitical media platform sharing culture, business, and grassroots change. Dive deeper with our flagship podcast and video series—BiharCast—and explore voices shaping the new Bihar.</strong></p>\n",
