    "id": "muzaffarpurs-%e2%82%b9213-25-crore-marine-drive-style-lake-front-to-open-this-new-year",
    "legacyId": 5377,
    "title": "Muzaffarpur’s ₹213.25-Crore Marine Drive-Style Lake Front to Open This New Year",
    "summary": "“Muzaffarpur’s ₹213.25-Crore Marine Drive-Style Lake Front Nears Completion—A New Year Glow Is Coming!” A New Year Buzz in Muzaffarpur: Sikandarpur Lake Front Almost Ready to Shine Muzaffarpur is buzzing with excitement as the city inches closer to unveiling one of its most ambitious urban projects ever—the Sikandarpur Lake Front, inspired by Marine Drive aesthetics. Although [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h3 data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"620\"><strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"620\">“Muzaffarpur’s ₹213.25-Crore Marine Drive-Style Lake Front Nears Completion—A New Year Glow Is Coming!”</strong></h3>\n<h2 data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"724\"><strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"722\">A New Year Buzz in Muzaffarpur: Sikandarpur Lake Front Almost Ready to Shine</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"1075\">Muzaffarpur is buzzing with excitement as the city inches closer to unveiling one of its most ambitious urban projects ever—the <strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"879\">Sikandarpur Lake Front</strong>, inspired by Marine Drive aesthetics. Although the project is <em data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"967\">not fully completed yet</em>, work has moved into its final phase, and the city is already feeling the vibe of something big on the way.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1125\"><strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1123\">A Transformative Vision for North Bihar</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1474\">Developed under <strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1168\">Muzaffarpur Smart City</strong>, this ₹213.25-crore mega development aims to change how people experience public spaces. The lake, once ignored, is evolving into a clean, vibrant, and modern recreational zone. Moreover, its location within the city makes it accessible to families, students, morning walkers, tourists, and nature lovers.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1649\">Even in its incomplete state, people are stopping by to take a look. The improved pathways, fresh plantations, and glowing lights hint at the beauty that is about to unfold.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1721\"><strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1719\">What’s Coming Soon: Features That Will Redefine Urban Leisure</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1935\">While finishing touches continue, many elements of the project already reflect the scale of transformation. The idea is simple—create a space where people can relax, walk, breathe, and enjoy the city in a new way.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1975\">✨ <strong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1975\">Highlights You Will Soon See</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2462\">\n<li data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2051\">\n<p data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2051\">A spacious <strong data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2007\">Community Hall</strong> for cultural, social, and creative events</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2120\">\n<p data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2120\">A smooth <strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2080\">walking track</strong> ideal for morning and evening fitness</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2190\">\n<p data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2190\">A modern <strong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2148\">Boating Club</strong>, expected to attract youth and families</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2276\">\n<p data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2276\">Colourful <strong data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2220\">selfie points</strong>, decorative <strong data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2246\">fountains</strong>, and stylish ambient lights</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2370\">\n<p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2370\">A beautiful <strong data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2315\">night lighting setup</strong> that will eventually give the lake a glowing skyline</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2462\">\n<p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2462\">Waste-to-art installations inspired by <strong data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2430\">Pinjore Garden</strong>, adding an eco-creative touch</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2616\">These features, once fully ready, will give Muzaffarpur a new identity. And, importantly, they will offer residents a refreshing escape within the city.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2666\"><strong data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2664\">A Green Heart in the Middle of the City</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2951\">Environmental care sits at the centre of the project. The Smart City team has planted trees along the lake edges, which already attract birds and bring freshness to the space. Additionally, modern ecological techniques are being used to improve water quality and protect biodiversity.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3127\">The efforts of the Smart City team, led by <strong data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3052\">Municipal Commissioner Vikram Virkar (@VikramVirkar)</strong>, deserve recognition for pushing the project ahead despite earlier delays.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3186\"><strong data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3184\">Expected to Become North Bihar’s New Destination</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3391\">Even before completion, Sikandarpur Lake Front has become a talking point across North Bihar. Locals expect the place to become a prime venue for events, cultural festivals, morning routines, and tourism.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3579\">Though the project is not finished yet, the team is working steadily to make the lakefront accessible soon. The city now waits eagerly, hoping for its grand opening in the coming months.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3584\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3642\"><strong data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3640\">Want More Inspiring Bihar Development Stories?</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"4060\">Follow <strong data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3670\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3668\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong> for regular updates and join our growing <strong data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3740\">13k+ community worldwide</strong>.<br data-start=\"3741\" data-end=\"3744\" /><strong data-start=\"3744\" data-end=\"3757\">Bihar Say</strong>, the state’s leading apolitical storytelling platform, continues to reshape Bihar’s image through powerful stories on culture, business, and grassroots changemakers. Its flagship video-podcast series, <strong data-start=\"3959\" data-end=\"3972\">BiharCast</strong>, brings untold stories from the heart of Bihar.<br data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4023\" /><strong data-start=\"4023\" data-end=\"4060\">Join the movement—stay connected!</strong></p>\n",
