    "id": "sonpur-mela-2025-special-trains-full-list-timings-travel-guide",
    "legacyId": 5370,
    "title": "Sonpur Mela 2025 Special Trains: Full List, Timings & Travel Guide",
    "summary": "Sonpur Mela 2025: Special Trains, Fresh Buzz & A Smoother Journey Than Ever! If you have ever wanted to feel Bihar’s cultural heartbeat in one place, Sonpur Mela 2025 is calling louder than ever. The energy is rising, the stalls are ready, and now Indian Railways has stepped in to make your journey easier than [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h1 data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"620\"><strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"620\">Sonpur Mela 2025: Special Trains, Fresh Buzz &amp; A Smoother Journey Than Ever!</strong></h1>\n<p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"872\">If you have ever wanted to feel Bihar’s cultural heartbeat in one place, <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"715\">Sonpur Mela 2025</strong> is calling louder than ever. The energy is rising, the stalls are ready, and now <strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"816\">Indian Railways</strong> has stepped in to make your journey easier than before.</p>\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1121\">This year, the <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"911\">Railway Department</strong> has arranged <strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"943\">Special Trains</strong> to ensure thousands of travellers reach the fairground without stress. And that single update has already sparked excitement across <strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1087\">Bhojpur</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1098\">Arrah</strong>, and nearby districts.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1126\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1182\"><strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1182\">Why Sonpur Mela Still Rules the Hearts of Bihar</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1524\">Sonpur Mela is not just a fair. It is an emotion.<br data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1236\" />People from Bhojpur have visited it for generations. Earlier, visitors even travelled by boats because no other options existed. However, things have changed beautifully. Now, families plan their trips days in advance, and they prefer the <strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1523\">comfort, safety, and affordability of trains</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1733\">The fair once again shines as a top attraction. Moreover, the festive atmosphere pulls people of every age. Many families want to explore the mela, taste the food, enjoy rides, and catch live cultural shows.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1738\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1803\"><strong data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1803\">Train Travel: The Smartest Way to Reach Sonpur Mela 2025</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"2056\">Travelling by train to Sonpur is not only easy. It is also the <strong data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1899\">fastest and most convenient</strong> way, especially during the mela rush.<br data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1940\" />From <strong data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1961\">Ara Junction</strong>, several trains run straight to <strong data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2005\">Hajipur</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2020\">Sonpur</strong> via <strong data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2036\">Danapur</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2055\">Patliputra</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2258\">Since Hajipur Station sits very close to the mela ground, you can reach the venue within minutes after arriving.<br data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2173\" />Additionally, train travel saves you from heavy traffic, roadblocks, and long delays.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2397\">Many people prefer starting early. They travel in the morning, enjoy the fair all day, and return by evening or night without any stress.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2402\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2461\"><strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2461\">Popular Train Options From Ara to Sonpur &amp; Hajipur</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2509\">Here are some convenient choices for visitors:</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2554\"><strong data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2552\">1. Ara–Jaynagar Intercity Express</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2642\">\n<li data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2599\">\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2599\">Departure: <strong data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2579\">5:40 AM</strong> from Ara Junction</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2642\">\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2642\">Arrival: Around <strong data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2629\">8:20 AM</strong> at Hajipur</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2722\">This timing works perfectly for travellers who want a full day at Sonpur Mela.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2765\"><strong data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2763\">2. Other Local &amp; Express Trains</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2895\">Several local and express trains operate from morning till noon. These trains help visitors plan flexible travel without rushing.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2939\"><strong data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2937\">3. Evening &amp; Night Return Trains</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"3187\">If you love evening shows, theatres, or cultural events at the mela, you can stay longer.<br data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3032\" />Special trains, including the <strong data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3084\">North East Express</strong>, start from Hajipur around <strong data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3120\">4 AM</strong>, allowing you to return comfortably even after a late-night visit.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3260\">With so many options, every traveller gets a suitable route and timing.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3265\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3315\"><strong data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3315\">Why These Special Trains Matter This Year</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3546\">The rush at Sonpur Mela grows every year. Therefore, this new railway plan will help manage crowds, improve safety, and support tourism.<br data-start=\"3453\" data-end=\"3456\" />It will also help small businesses, local artists, and food vendors attract more visitors.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3637\">Because of these special trains, planning a Sonpur Mela trip has become easier than ever.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4848\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">For more verified updates, cultural stories, travel news, and emotional narratives from every corner of the state, <strong data-start=\"4563\" data-end=\"4590\">follow <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4588\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong> and become part of our fast-growing <strong data-start=\"4627\" data-end=\"4655\">13,000+ global community</strong>.<br data-start=\"4656\" data-end=\"4659\" /><strong data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4672\">Bihar Say</strong> is Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform, partnering with <strong data-start=\"4752\" data-end=\"4765\">DailyHunt</strong> and known for insightful series like <strong data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4816\">BiharCast</strong>—your doorway to the real Bihar.</p>\n",
