    "id": "assembly-elections-bihar-set-for-vote-counting-tomorrow-across-46-centres-in-38-districts",
    "legacyId": 5364,
    "title": "Assembly Elections: Bihar set for Vote Counting tomorrow across 46 centres in 38 districts",
    "summary": "All Eyes on Bihar: Vote Counting Begins Tomorrow Across 46 Centres — A Historic Election Awaits Its Verdict! Bihar Awaits Its Big Verdict The air in Bihar is thick with anticipation. After weeks of campaigning, two phases of voting, and record-breaking participation, the Assembly Election results are just hours away. From Patna to Purnea, people [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h1 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"138\"><em data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"136\">All Eyes on Bihar: Vote Counting Begins Tomorrow Across 46 Centres — A Historic Election Awaits Its Verdict!</em></h1>\n<hr data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"143\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"179\">Bihar Awaits Its Big Verdict</h3>\n<p data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"495\">The air in Bihar is thick with anticipation. After weeks of campaigning, two phases of voting, and record-breaking participation, the <strong data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"344\">Assembly Election results</strong> are just hours away. From Patna to Purnea, people are waiting eagerly as counting begins <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"454\">tomorrow at 8 AM</strong> across <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"492\">46 centres in 38 districts</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"823\">This year’s election is not just another political event — it’s a <strong data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"605\">landmark in Bihar’s democratic journey</strong>. With an impressive <strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"650\">67.13% voter turnout</strong>, the state has witnessed its <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"726\">highest-ever polling percentage since 1951</strong>. The enthusiasm reflects the citizens’ growing trust in democracy and their desire for change.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"828\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"872\">Inside the Nerve Centre of Democracy</h3>\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1184\">At the heart of this massive exercise are the <strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"957\">Electronic Voting Machines (EVMs)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1010\">Voter Verifiable Paper Audit Trails (VVPATs)</strong>, safely stored in <strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1045\">strong rooms</strong> under <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1076\">three-layer security</strong>. Each machine carries the fate of <strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1131\">2,616 candidates</strong>, representing 243 constituencies across the state.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1462\">Chief Electoral Officer <strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1234\">Vinod Singh Gunjiyal</strong> told <em data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1256\">Akashvani News</em> that stringent measures have been taken to ensure transparency and fairness. He emphasized that <strong data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1378\">every counting centre</strong> is under <strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1423\">elaborate security arrangements</strong>, ensuring a smooth and safe process.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1628\">The Election Commission of India and the Bihar administration have worked hand-in-hand to guarantee that the <strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1597\">voice of every voter</strong> is heard without compromise.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1633\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1677\">Bihar’s Record-Breaking Voter Spirit</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1900\">This election has been remarkable not just for its numbers but for its energy. People from every corner of Bihar — youth, women, first-time voters, and senior citizens — came together to shape the future of their state.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"2050\">Moreover, <strong data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1975\">the enthusiasm seen in rural belts, towns, and cities alike</strong> showcases a shared dream — a better, stronger, and more empowered Bihar.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2267\">From <strong data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2081\">Gaya’s determination</strong> to <strong data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2106\">Darbhanga’s drive</strong>, every ballot reflects a story of hope. As the results unfold, one thing remains certain: <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2265\">Bihar’s people have already won by turning up in record numbers.</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2272\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2295\">What Comes Next</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2583\">Tomorrow’s counting will not only decide the next government but also reveal what the people of Bihar truly envision for their future. The spotlight will be on <strong data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2479\">key constituencies</strong>, political veterans, and first-time contenders who represent the changing face of Bihar’s leadership.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2585\" data-end=\"2746\">As the results roll in, stay tuned for <strong data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2684\">live updates, local reactions, and ground-level insights</strong> — only on <strong data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2743\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2741\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"3021\">Join our <strong data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2792\">13,000+ strong global community</strong> that celebrates Bihar’s progress, voices, and culture. Follow Bihar Say — <strong data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2929\">Bihar’s leading apolitical media and storytelling platform</strong>, reshaping the state’s image through stories of business, culture, and grassroots change.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3113\">Let’s witness history together — because <strong data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3111\">every vote counts, and every story matters.</strong></p>\n",
    "category": "Education & Social",
    "categorySlug": "education-social",
    "date": "Nov 13, 2025",
    "author": "Bihar Say Desk",
    "imageUrl": "/legacy-images/bihar-election-vote-counting-evm.jpg",
