    "id": "bihar-election-2025-phase-2-witnessed-a-record-68-76-turnout-across-122-constituencies",
    "legacyId": 5354,
    "title": "Bihar Election 2025 Phase 2 witnessed a record 68.76% turnout across 122 constituencies",
    "summary": "Record-Breaking Bihar Votes: 68.76% Turnout Ignites Hope and High Stakes in Phase 2 Elections! Bihar Election 2025 Phase 2 Voting LIVE Updates: Historic Turnout Sparks Political Momentum Patna, Bihar: Democracy roared louder than ever in Bihar as the state witnessed a record 68.76% voter turnout during the second and final phase of the Bihar Assembly [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"123\"><em data-start=\"25\" data-end=\"121\">Record-Breaking Bihar Votes: 68.76% Turnout Ignites Hope and High Stakes in Phase 2 Elections!</em></p>\n<hr data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"128\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"226\">Bihar Election 2025 Phase 2 Voting LIVE Updates: Historic Turnout Sparks Political Momentum</h2>\n<p data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"553\"><strong data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"245\">Patna, Bihar:</strong> Democracy roared louder than ever in Bihar as the state witnessed a <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"345\">record 68.76% voter turnout</strong> during the <strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"383\">second and final phase</strong> of the <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"424\">Bihar Assembly Elections 2025</strong>. From early morning queues to sunset selfies, the energy in polling booths reflected a new wave of civic awareness and change.</p>\n<p data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"770\">This phase holds massive significance for <strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"638\">Chief Minister Nitish Kumar’s cabinet</strong>, as <strong data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"659\">12 ministers</strong> from his government are contesting. Every vote, therefore, carries political weight and emotional resonance.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"775\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"826\">Enthusiasm Unfolds Across 122 Constituencies</h2>\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1074\">Voting began sharply at <strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"862\">7 a.m.</strong> across <strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"901\">122 critical constituencies</strong> spanning <strong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"927\">20 districts</strong>. Despite a busy weekday, citizens stepped out in impressive numbers, marking one of the <strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1071\">highest voter turnouts in Bihar’s electoral history</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1334\">From first-time voters capturing their inked fingers to elderly citizens proudly standing in queues, Bihar’s democratic spirit was on full display. Moreover, women voters turned out in greater numbers, underscoring Bihar’s evolving political participation.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1339\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1404\">Tight Security and Border Sealing Amid High-Stakes Polling</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1692\">As polling intensified, <strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1470\">security forces heightened vigilance</strong> across the state. The <strong data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1509\">Bihar Police</strong>, under the leadership of <strong data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1554\">DGP Vinay Kumar</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1621\">sealed the 700-kilometre-long international border with Nepal</strong> for 72 hours — a strong preventive step to maintain peace and order.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1989\">This decision came amid reports of heightened alert following a <strong data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1796\">recent blast incident in New Delhi</strong>, prompting Bihar’s security agencies to remain proactive. Seven border districts — currently witnessing voting — are under strict monitoring, ensuring smooth conduct across polling stations.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"1994\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2050\">The Pulse of Bihar: Change, Awareness, and Action</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2343\">Every election in Bihar carries an emotional pulse, a sense of identity intertwined with hope. Phase 2 proved no different. Conversations around employment, education, and governance dominated public discourse, while young voters emerged as the defining force behind this historic turnout.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2491\">The emotional intensity on the ground clearly signaled one thing — <strong data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2489\">Bihar is ready to redefine its future through the power of participation.</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2496\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2518\">What Lies Ahead</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2772\">With the completion of Phase 2, all eyes now turn to the <strong data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2593\">counting day</strong>, where numbers will decide narratives. However, beyond politics and predictions, this record turnout tells a larger story — of a state that believes, participates, and evolves.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2777\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2819\">Want more real-time Bihar updates?</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"3081\">👉 Stay tuned to <strong data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2885\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2883\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong> for LIVE election stories, cultural insights, and inspiring ground reports.<br data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2964\" />Be part of our <strong data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3004\">13K+ global community</strong> that’s redefining how the world sees Bihar — one powerful story at a time.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3576\"><strong data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3132\">Bihar Say</strong> is Bihar’s leading <em data-start=\"3152\" data-end=\"3196\">apolitical media and storytelling platform</em>, reshaping the state’s image through impactful stories on <strong data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3299\">culture, business, and grassroots change</strong>.<br data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3303\" />With <strong data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3329\">13,000+ followers</strong>, top <strong data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3359\">LinkedIn impressions</strong>, and partnerships with <strong data-start=\"3383\" data-end=\"3396\">DailyHunt</strong>, Bihar Say stands as the <em data-start=\"3422\" data-end=\"3446\">digital voice of Bihar</em>.<br data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3450\" />Its flagship show, <strong data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3482\">BiharCast</strong>, brings forward <strong data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3517\">untold stories</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3519\" data-end=\"3535\">changemakers</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3576\">voices from the heart of Bihar.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4384\">\n",
