    "id": "patna-to-get-multi-modal-hub-model-vending-zone-elevated-road-near-airport",
    "legacyId": 5311,
    "title": "Patna to Get Multi-Modal Hub, Model Vending Zone & Elevated Road Near Airport",
    "summary": "“Patna Rising: Multi-Modal Hub, Smart Vending Zone & Elevated Road Near Airport Set to Redefine the City’s Future!” A City on the Move Drive through Patna today, and you can feel the pulse of change. The capital of Bihar isn’t standing still anymore—it’s evolving fast. The city is preparing for a major transformation under Chief [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h1 data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"512\"><strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"512\">“Patna Rising: Multi-Modal Hub, Smart Vending Zone &amp; Elevated Road Near Airport Set to Redefine the City’s Future!”</strong></h1>\n<h2 data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1297\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1295\">A City on the Move</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1616\">Drive through Patna today, and you can feel the pulse of change. The capital of Bihar isn’t standing still anymore—it’s evolving fast. The city is preparing for a major transformation under Chief Minister <strong data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1535\">Nitish Kumar’s Pragati Yatra</strong> on <strong data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1554\">February 21</strong>, where projects worth nearly ₹1,350 crore will be launched.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1861\">Among these initiatives are a <strong data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1667\">multi-modal hub</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1693\">model vending zone</strong>, and an <strong data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1736\">elevated road near the airport</strong>—each one crafted to ease congestion and modernize city life. Together, they mark a turning point for Patna’s urban future.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1866\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1914\"><strong data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1912\">Multi-Modal Hub: Where All Roads Meet</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"2083\">Patna’s upcoming <strong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1951\">multi-modal hub</strong> will unify the way people move. It’s designed to bring buses, autos, e-rickshaws, and inter-city transport under one modern roof.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2380\">The plan includes a <strong data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2137\">multi-level complex near GPO</strong>, linked to <strong data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2167\">Patna Junction</strong> through a pedestrian subway. It will feature digital displays, elevators, EV charging bays, and spacious waiting zones. Moreover, real-time coordination between transit modes will cut travel time significantly.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2577\">This is not just a structure—it’s a statement of intent. As traffic density grows, the hub will simplify commutes, reduce chaos, and create a smoother, greener mobility experience for citizens.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2582\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2647\"><strong data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2645\">Model Vending Zone: Empowering the Heart of the Market</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2820\">Patna’s streets have long been a mix of energy and congestion. Street vendors bring life to the city, yet the lack of structured space has caused frequent traffic snarls.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"3127\">To address this, the administration is developing <strong data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2895\">model vending zones</strong> that balance order with opportunity. Vendors will now operate from well-defined stalls with lighting, sanitation, and storage facilities. Additionally, proper footpaths will return to pedestrians, easing both movement and safety.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3312\">This initiative celebrates inclusivity. Instead of displacing traders, it integrates them into a cleaner, more organized ecosystem—preserving livelihoods while reshaping urban flow.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3317\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3381\"><strong data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3379\">Elevated Road Near Airport: A Gateway to Global Patna</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3583\">The new <strong data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3440\">elevated road near Jay Prakash Narayan Airport</strong> is another bold step forward. With passenger traffic rising after the new terminal opening, this link will ensure swift and seamless access.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3585\" data-end=\"3846\">The project envisions a <strong data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3640\">four-lane elevated corridor</strong> that cuts travel time from city centers to the airport dramatically. Furthermore, it connects to broader infrastructure goals under the <strong data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3796\">Patna Ring Road</strong> plan, strengthening routes to Bihta and beyond.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3976\">For travelers, this means fewer jams and quicker routes. For businesses, it’s a sign that Patna is ready for global attention.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3978\" data-end=\"3981\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"3983\" data-end=\"4026\"><strong data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4024\">A Ripple Effect Across Rural Patna</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4358\">While urban projects take the spotlight, rural Patna isn’t left behind. A new road will soon link the <strong data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4146\">Bihta–Sarmera</strong> route with <strong data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4175\">Daniyawan Top</strong>, improving inter-block travel. Local residents near <strong data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4241\">Naubatpur</strong> have also been advocating for a <strong data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4301\">flyover at Nispura Lakh</strong>—a long-pending demand that might finally see approval.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4360\" data-end=\"4620\">Additionally, large ponds and lakes are being rejuvenated under <strong data-start=\"4424\" data-end=\"4434\">MNREGA</strong> and <strong data-start=\"4439\" data-end=\"4469\">Jal-Jeevan-Hariyali Yojana</strong>, supporting both irrigation and ecology. These parallel efforts ensure that growth spreads evenly, not just within the city but across the district.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4625\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"4627\" data-end=\"4677\"><strong data-start=\"4630\" data-end=\"4675\">Why It Matters: Patna’s Image Is Changing</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"4678\" data-end=\"4933\">This transformation is more than construction—it’s confidence in motion. For years, Patna has battled the stereotype of being “slow to grow.” Now, these projects show a city stepping into its own, ready to attract investors, students, and entrepreneurs.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4935\" data-end=\"5126\">Every bridge, road, and zone adds a layer of pride. And as these developments unfold, they redefine Bihar’s identity on the national map—not as a story of catching up, but of leading ahead.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5131\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5170\"><strong data-start=\"5136\" data-end=\"5168\">Be Part of Bihar’s New Story</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"5171\" data-end=\"5404\">Infrastructure isn’t just about concrete—it’s about community. When residents care, cities rise stronger. Patna’s ongoing projects prove that coordinated efforts between citizens, planners, and leadership can create lasting impact.</p>\n<p data-start=\"5406\" data-end=\"5489\">Stay informed, get involved, and share the story that Bihar is writing every day.</p>\n<p data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5665\">👉 <strong data-start=\"5494\" data-end=\"5549\">Follow <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"5503\" data-end=\"5547\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong> for regular updates—and <strong data-start=\"5574\" data-end=\"5608\">join our 13K+ global community</strong> celebrating Bihar’s growth, culture, and changemakers.</p>\n",
