    "id": "back-to-work-after-chhath-puja-8-special-trains-from-bihar-make-return-to-delhi-mumbai-bengaluru-easier",
    "legacyId": 5296,
    "title": "Back to Work After Chhath Puja? 8 Special Trains from Bihar Make Return to Delhi, Mumbai & Bengaluru Easier",
    "summary": "The Journey Home Made Easy As the fourth day of the vibrant Chhath Puja (which concludes on 28 October) draws to a close, many festival-goers in Bihar are preparing to head back to their workplaces in other states. According to reports, 8 special trains will be deployed to ease this massive movement of people. These [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h2 data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"685\">The Journey Home Made Easy</h2>\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"1075\">As the fourth day of the vibrant Chhath Puja (which concludes on 28 October) draws to a close, many festival-goers in Bihar are preparing to head back to their workplaces in other states. According to reports, 8 special trains will be deployed to ease this massive movement of people. These services aim to connect Bihar with major hubs like Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru and towns in Gujarat.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1080\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1120\">Why These 8 Special Trains Matter</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1640\">First, the holiday rush after a major festival often leads to congestion, long queues and uncertain travel. Secondly, many travellers find regular trains full or difficult to book. With dedicated special trains, travellers gain better access — including sleepers, general and AC coaches.<br data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1412\" />Notably, these trains will begin operations <strong data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1475\">from 28 October</strong> onwards on various routes, thereby enabling smoother return journeys from Bihar. According to local media, they will especially benefit passengers in North Bihar.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1645\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1674\">Which Trains Will Run?</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1710\">Here are the 8 trains announced:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"2130\">\n<li data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1762\">\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1762\">Train No. 04651: Jayanagar → Amritsar (Special)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1819\">\n<p data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1819\">Train No. 04097: Hasanpur Road → New Delhi (Special)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1877\">\n<p data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1877\">Train No. 04732: Samastipur → Sriganganagar (Special)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1930\">\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1930\">Train No. 04449: Darbhanga → New Delhi (Special)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1984\">\n<p data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1984\">Train No. 07358: Raxaul → UBL (Bengaluru) Special</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2035\">\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2035\">Train No. 05557: Raxaul → LTT (Mumbai) Special</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2082\">\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2082\">Train No. 09068: Jayanagar → Udhna Special</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2130\">\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2130\">Train No. 09070: Samastipur → Udhna Special</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2265\">By introducing these routes, the rail network expands relief and return-options for those heading back to metros and industrial hubs.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2270\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2313\">What to Keep in Mind Before Boarding</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2817\">\n<li data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2405\">\n<p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2405\"><strong data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2331\">Book early</strong>: Seats are limited and with the festival rush, availability drops fast.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2505\">\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2505\"><strong data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2431\">Check class options</strong>: These specials include AC, Sleeper and General—so pick what suits you.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2603\">\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2603\"><strong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2530\">Routes and timings</strong>: They vary by origin and destination; verify schedule ahead of travel.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2702\">\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2702\"><strong data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2636\">Extra coaches may be added</strong>: Officials say extra coaches will be attached if demand surges.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2817\">\n<p data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2817\"><strong data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2734\">Plan arrival to main hubs</strong>: Whether you’re going to Delhi, Mumbai or Bengaluru, ensure onward connectivity.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2822\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2871\">Why This Move Matters for Bihar Travellers</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"3118\">By launching these specials, the railways recognise the massive travel demand from Bihar during Chhath and other festivals. For many from Bihar working in metro cities, the return journey often is fraught with uncertainty. Thanks to this move:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3366\">\n<li data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3200\">\n<p data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3200\">It offers <strong data-start=\"3131\" data-end=\"3154\">better connectivity</strong> between Bihar and major employment centres.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3282\">\n<p data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3282\">It shows a <strong data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3245\">responsive transport policy</strong>, matching travel peak with supply.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3366\">\n<p data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3366\">It helps families return home, celebrate, and then go back without undue delay.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3371\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3403\">Stay Informed, Stay Ahead</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3405\" data-end=\"3709\">Want daily updates on Bihar’s infrastructure, transit news and transport developments? Follow <strong data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3519\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3517\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong> for real-time stories. Join our 13K+ global community and be part of Bihar’s transformation through stories on culture, business and grassroots change. 👉 Visit now and never miss a beat!</p>\n<div class=\"mb-1 mt-6\" data-testid=\"nav-list-widget\">\n<div class=\"text-token-text-primary -mb-1 pb-3 font-semibold\"></div>\n</div>\n",
