    "id": "bihars-first-acute-stroke-care-unit-to-open-at-aiims-patna",
    "legacyId": 5285,
    "title": "Bihar’s First Acute Stroke Care Unit to Open at AIIMS Patna",
    "summary": "“Every Second Counts”: AIIMS Patna Leads Bihar’s Fight Against Stroke with ‘Stroke Update 2025’ When every second decides between life and paralysis, AIIMS Patna is rewriting Bihar’s healthcare story.With its bold step, “Stroke Update 2025,” the institute has launched a movement to bring speed, science, and hope to stroke patients across the state. AIIMS Patna’s [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h2 data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"485\"><strong data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"485\">“Every Second Counts”: AIIMS Patna Leads Bihar’s Fight Against Stroke with ‘Stroke Update 2025’</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"758\">When every second decides between life and paralysis, <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"556\">AIIMS Patna</strong> is rewriting Bihar’s healthcare story.<br data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"598\" />With its bold step, <strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"643\">“Stroke Update 2025,”</strong> the institute has launched a movement to bring <em data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"708\">speed, science,</em> and <em data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"719\">hope</em> to stroke patients across the state.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"763\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"826\"><strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"826\">AIIMS Patna’s Landmark Initiative: Stroke Update 2025</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1152\">The <strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"889\">All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS) Patna</strong> has introduced a transformative program to change stroke care in Bihar.<br data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"964\" />Titled <strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"996\">“Stroke Update 2025,”</strong> the initiative focuses on <em data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1059\">rapid diagnosis, timely treatment,</em> and <em data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1095\">collaboration between experts</em>—three elements that can save lives when time is short.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1480\">Jointly organized by the <strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1224\">Departments of Neurology and Neurosurgery</strong>, the event was inaugurated by <strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1289\">Prof. (Brig.) Dr. Raju Agarwal</strong>, Director of AIIMS Patna.<br data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1318\" />During the event, he announced the creation of a <strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1403\">dedicated Acute Stroke Care Unit</strong>—a specialized facility designed to deliver immediate, evidence-based care.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1633\">“Timely intervention is the key to preserving life and neurological function,” said <strong data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1583\">Prof. Agarwal</strong>, urging hospitals to act faster than ever before.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1638\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1699\"><strong data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1699\">Acute Stroke Care Unit: Where Time Meets Technology</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1958\">The upcoming <strong data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1740\">Acute Stroke Care Unit</strong> will handle <em data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1767\">thrombolysis</em> and <em data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1797\">mechanical thrombectomy</em>, two procedures that can reverse brain damage if done quickly.<br data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1863\" />This development ensures that patients in Bihar receive world-class treatment without delays.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2264\"><strong data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1987\">Prof. Vikas Chandra Jha</strong>, Head of Neurosurgery, shared crucial insights.<br data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2038\" />Nearly <em data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2083\">80% of strokes in India are ischemic</em> and can be treated if addressed in time.<br data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2127\" />He also pointed to the <em data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2197\">alarming rise in strokes among younger adults</em>, calling for stronger emergency systems and awareness campaigns.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2269\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2334\"><strong data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2334\">Uniting Experts for Faster Response and Better Recovery</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2662\">The event brought together more than <strong data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2388\">200 experts</strong>, including neurologists, neurosurgeons, and general physicians from <strong data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2480\">AIIMS, PMCH, IGIMS,</strong> and regional hospitals.<br data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2507\" />Through discussions on <em data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2565\">emergency triage, rehabilitation,</em> and <em data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2589\">neurointervention</em>, the program inspired collaboration across Bihar’s healthcare network.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2938\">Additionally, the speakers emphasized <em data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2741\">ambulance-based rapid response models</em> and the need to expand <em data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2789\">stroke-ready hospitals</em> throughout the state.<br data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2814\" />The initiative also aligns with the <strong data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2889\">National Health Programme’s mission</strong> to strengthen critical care in every district.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2943\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3017\"><strong data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3017\">Beyond Treatment: Building a Future of Compassion and Innovation</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3232\">For AIIMS Patna, this is not just a hospital project—it’s a <em data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3100\">promise of progress</em>.<br data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3104\" />The institute aims to create a <strong data-start=\"3135\" data-end=\"3163\">statewide stroke network</strong>, connecting rural and urban Bihar under one efficient care system.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3234\" data-end=\"3456\">“Stroke Update 2025 is a milestone in neurological care. It reflects AIIMS Patna’s commitment to innovation, compassion, and clinical excellence,” said <strong data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3399\">Prof. Jha</strong>, expressing hope for a healthier and more aware Bihar.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3461\" />\n<p data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3730\">For more inspiring stories that redefine Bihar’s growth in health, culture, and innovation —<br data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3558\" /><strong data-start=\"3558\" data-end=\"3613\">follow <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3611\">www.biharsay.com</a></strong> and join our <strong data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3653\">13k+ global community!</strong><br data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3656\" />Let’s celebrate the Bihar that heals, builds, and inspires the world. 🌍</p>\n",
    "category": "Culture & Heritage",
    "categorySlug": "culture-heritage",
    "date": "Oct 18, 2025",
