    "id": "166-additional-flights-to-patna-for-diwali-chhath-2025",
    "legacyId": 5279,
    "title": "166 Additional Flights to Patna for Diwali & Chhath 2025",
    "summary": "Patna Welcomes 166 Extra Flights for Diwali & Chhath Puja This festive season, Patna is set to become the travel hotspot of Bihar. Air India and its subsidiary Air India Express have announced a massive addition of 166 extra flights to meet soaring travel demand during Diwali and Chhath Puja. Consequently, passengers traveling from key [&hellip;]",
    "content": "<h2 data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"888\">Patna Welcomes 166 Extra Flights for Diwali &amp; Chhath Puja</h2>\n<p data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"1298\">This festive season, Patna is set to become the travel hotspot of Bihar. <strong data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"976\">Air India</strong> and its subsidiary <strong data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1017\">Air India Express</strong> have announced a massive addition of <strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1076\">166 extra flights</strong> to meet soaring travel demand during <strong data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1124\">Diwali</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1144\">Chhath Puja</strong>. Consequently, passengers traveling from key cities like Delhi, Mumbai, and Bengaluru can now enjoy more convenient schedules and smoother connections.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1496\">The additional flights begin operations <strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1360\">October 15, 2025</strong>, and continue until <strong data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1401\">November 3, 2025</strong>. Therefore, travelers should plan early to secure their seats and avoid last-minute hassles.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1501\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1546\">Air India: Expanded Routes and Numbers</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1627\"><strong data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1561\">Air India</strong> will operate <strong data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1601\">114 additional flights</strong> to Patna. Specifically:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1747\">\n<li data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1666\">\n<p data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1666\"><strong data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1647\">Delhi–Patna:</strong> 38 extra flights</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1705\">\n<p data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1705\"><strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1686\">Mumbai–Patna:</strong> 38 extra flights</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1747\">\n<p data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1747\"><strong data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1728\">Bengaluru–Patna:</strong> 38 extra flights</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1939\">Moreover, these flights complement the existing <strong data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1828\">42 weekly Air India flights</strong> from Delhi and Mumbai. As a result, passengers have more flexibility to choose their preferred travel times.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1944\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1998\">Air India Express Enhances Festive Connectivity</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2095\">Similarly, <strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2032\">Air India Express</strong> adds <strong data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2052\">52 flights</strong> between October 22 and November 3, 2025:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2186\">\n<li data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2139\">\n<p data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2139\"><strong data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2115\">Delhi–Patna:</strong> 26 additional flights</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2186\">\n<p data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2186\"><strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2162\">Bengaluru–Patna:</strong> 26 additional flights</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2395\">Additionally, these flights supplement the current <strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2278\">14 weekly Air India Express flights</strong>. Therefore, the festive travel rush is expected to ease considerably, offering passengers more convenient options.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2400\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2468\">Smooth Connections to Domestic and International Destinations</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2764\">Furthermore, these additional flights not only boost domestic connectivity but also facilitate <strong data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2617\">seamless transfers to international destinations</strong> via Delhi, Mumbai, and Bengaluru hubs. Consequently, travelers heading to the <strong data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2711\">Middle East</strong> or <strong data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2725\">Europe</strong> can coordinate layovers efficiently.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"3032\">This expansion is particularly helpful for <strong data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2834\">Biharis living abroad</strong> who wish to celebrate Diwali and Chhath with their families. Indeed, the move reflects the airlines’ commitment to serving passengers’ festive travel needs while minimizing congestion and delays.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3037\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3075\">How to Book Your Festive Flight</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3143\">Booking for these flights is now open through multiple channels:</p>\n<ol data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3333\">\n<li data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3226\">\n<p data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3226\"><strong data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3169\">Official websites</strong> and <strong data-start=\"3174\" data-end=\"3189\">mobile apps</strong> of Air India and Air India Express</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3227\" data-end=\"3256\">\n<p data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3256\"><strong data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3254\">24&#215;7 contact centres</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3300\">\n<p data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3300\"><strong data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3298\">City and airport ticketing offices</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3333\">\n<p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3333\"><strong data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3331\">Travel agents worldwide</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3437\">Hence, passengers can choose the most convenient booking method and ensure a smooth festive journey.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3442\" />\n<p data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3818\">Stay updated with the latest travel news and festive announcements by following <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.biharsay.com\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3565\"><strong data-start=\"3525\" data-end=\"3538\">Bihar Say</strong></a>. Become part of our <strong data-start=\"3586\" data-end=\"3620\">13,000+ strong global community</strong>, and enjoy regular insights on Bihar’s culture, business, and grassroots changes. Bihar Say is reshaping the state’s narrative with stories that matter, and you can be part of this journey today!</p>\n",
